OL,3,AWhy doomsday warnings are not the only
OL,4,Athreat to the AI juggernaut
OL,5,
OL,6,FWhy doomsday warnings are not the only
OL,7,Fthreat to the AI juggernaut
OL,9,FThere is an eerie low hum that emanates
OL,10,Ffrom data centres, where tens of
OL,11,Fthousands of chips make trillions of
OL,12,Fcomputations a second to help drive the
OL,13,Fartificial intelligence (AI)
OL,14,Frevolution.
OL,16,FThese chips power the text, images and
OL,17,Fvideo generated by the queries made by
OL,18,Fthe world of the advanced AI models.
OL,23,APub: 15-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  BusinessC Nat TVF  Nat News
FL,109,105,200,300,0,100
